Package: taptone
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Free soundboard for voice chats
 TapTone plays sound effects on two outputs at once: locally (headphones) and into a
 "microphone route" that voice chats (Discord, games) use as their microphone input.
 Features a sound library (search, favourites, duplicates detection), global hotkeys,
 a green/black interface and soundpad://-style link downloads.
 .
 As upstream this package ships no audio driver or system audio component: route sounds
 to voice chats with your desktop audio server's virtual devices (PipeWire/PulseAudio),
 exactly like any other desktop application.
 .
 Status: PREPARED, NOT BUILT - packaging/README.md explains the verification steps.
